WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.790 --> 00:00:04.790
Every option sits in the bar above the game.

2
00:00:05.290 --> 00:00:12.340
Mode: campaign, time trial, endless, rush hour, orbs, rings, reversal, blackout, zen…

3
00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:14.720
Car paint: the livery of any country.

4
00:00:15.220 --> 00:00:21.700
Vehicle: from sports cars to trucks and Formula cars.

5
00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:27.880
Difficulty, from Easy to Insane.

6
00:00:28.380 --> 00:00:32.820
Weather: rain, snow, fog and more.

7
00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:37.710
Surface: asphalt, frozen lake, dunes…

8
00:00:38.210 --> 00:00:43.780
Time of day: dawn, day, dusk, night.

9
00:00:44.280 --> 00:00:47.130
Vision: filters for colour blindness and a high-contrast view.

10
00:00:47.630 --> 00:00:49.550
Assist: holds bends, self-centring, gentle walls.

11
00:00:50.050 --> 00:01:02.780
Press Enter and drive: arrows steer, Space is turbo.

12
00:01:03.280 --> 00:01:10.600
The interface comes in 8 languages.
